guide forever/class/priest/confounding-flash-and-contingency-plan
title Confounding Flash and Contingency Plan
category Class
class Priest
folder Priest
faction Alliance
race Gnome
levels 10-20
zone Ironforge
keywords Confounding Flash, Contingency Plan, High Priestess Mims, Maxan Anvol, Priestess Josetta, High Priestess Laurena, Hall of Mysteries, Mystic Ward, Gnome, racial, Priest
reward spell 1277455 "Confounding Flash"
reward spell 1277462 "Contingency Plan"
why The Gnome priest spells, new in Forever: Confounding Flash at 10, Contingency Plan at 20. Free, no objectives.

# The Gnome Priest spell quests, new in Forever. Each spell has one quest at
# the teacher, High Priestess Mims (Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic
# Ward, beside High Priest Rohan), and letters from priest trainers in other
# towns; any one teaches the spell:
#   Confounding Flash (level 10):
#     94817 High Priestess Mims (Ironforge), her own quest
#     94821 High Priestess Laurena (Cathedral of Light, Stormwind)
#     94822 Priestess Josetta (Goldshire, Elwynn Forest)
#     94824 Maxan Anvol (Kharanos, Dun Morogh)
#     94823, 94825, 94826: no giver in Forever's data.
#   Contingency Plan (level 20):
#     94818 High Priestess Mims (Ironforge), her own quest
#     94819 High Priestess Laurena (Stormwind)
#     94820: no giver in Forever's data.
# The guide sends you to the giver in the zone you stand in when it gets
# there (`when zone`), else straight to Mims; a letter you carry from
# anywhere is handed in on its own step (`when onquest`). Pickups are `talk`
# goals, not accepts, as in the other priest racial guides.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for Mims, 94817, 94819 and 94824;
# Forever's quest pages (snapshot, 2026-10-29) for 94818 (Mims gives and
# takes it), 94821 (Laurena) and 94822 (Josetta), added to the private
# corrections; Forever's Priest class quest list (data/local/quest-audit/):
# 94817-94826 new. Spells (Blizzard's Forever priest deep dive, September
# 2026, and Forever web guides to the priest racials): Confounding Flash
# confuses up to 5 enemies within 8 yards for 3 sec, damage breaks it, 0.5 sec
# cast, 2-minute cooldown; Contingency Plan wards an ally for 30 sec and
# shields and heals them if they drop below 35% health, 5-minute cooldown.
# ASSUMED: 94823, 94825 and 94826 are the letters from Laurna Morninglight
# (Dolanaar), Nara Meideros (Stormwind's Park) and Priestess Alathea
# (Darnassus), and 94820 Alathea's Contingency Plan letter: their texts match
# those trainers' other letters (Classic flow; Forever's data has no giver
# for them). In-game check: who offers them. The guide hands them in at Mims
# without naming a giver.
# ASSUMED: one quest of each set closes the others, like the Classic sets
# (Forever's data has no exclusive links for 94817-94826). In-game check:
# after one, Mims offers no second.
# Players' reports on 94821 and 94824 (September 2026) said an early text
# read "head to Stormwind"; the current texts name Mims in Ironforge.
# alliance/dwarf-gnome/01-dun-morogh carries Confounding Flash 94824 on the
# route (Maxan Anvol to Mims); alliance/04-redridge-mountains and
# 06-ashenvale carry Contingency Plan 94819 (Laurena to Mims).
# Based on data, not play: written from the sources above.

step Confounding Flash: Maxan Anvol
  when zone "Dun Morogh"
  when !onquest 94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip At 10, Maxan Anvol, the priest trainer inside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, hands you a Confounding Flash letter for High Priestess Mims in Ironforge. Kharanos is on the road up to the city.
  level 10
  talk 1226                                   -- Maxan Anvol: take his Confounding Flash letter

step Confounding Flash: Priestess Josetta
  when zone "Elwynn Forest"
  when !onquest 94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip At 10 in Elwynn Forest, Priestess Josetta, upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, hands you a Confounding Flash letter for High Priestess Mims in Ironforge.
  level 10
  talk 377                                    -- Priestess Josetta: take her Confounding Flash letter

step Confounding Flash: High Priestess Laurena
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  when !onquest 94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 10 in Stormwind, High Priestess Laurena at the altar of the Cathedral of Light hands you a Confounding Flash letter for High Priestess Mims in Ironforge (the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District).
  level 10
  talk 376                                    -- High Priestess Laurena: take her Confounding Flash letter

step Confounding Flash: High Priestess Mims
  when !onquest 94817,94821,94822,94823,94824,94825,94826
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 10, go to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward (north-west of the city), right beside High Priest Rohan: she gives Confounding Flash and takes it back at once. No letter needed. Confounding Flash confuses up to five enemies around you for 3 seconds (any damage wakes them) on a 2-minute cooldown: time to step back and heal, or to run.
  level 10
  accept 94817                                -- High Priestess Mims
  turnin 94817                                -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Confounding Flash: Maxan's letter
  when onquest 94824
  zone Ironforge
  tip Follow the road up from Kharanos into Ironforge and to the Mystic Ward: High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries takes the letter and teaches Confounding Flash.
  turnin 94824                                -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Confounding Flash: Josetta's letter
  when onquest 94822
  zone Ironforge
  tip Hand the letter to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward: the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's Dwarven District.
  turnin 94822 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Confounding Flash: Laurena's letter
  when onquest 94821
  zone Ironforge
  tip Hand the letter to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward: the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's Dwarven District.
  turnin 94821 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Confounding Flash: a letter from another trainer
  when onquest 94823
  zone Ironforge
  tip Any Confounding Flash letter goes to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward.
  turnin 94823 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Confounding Flash: a letter from another trainer
  when onquest 94825
  zone Ironforge
  tip Any Confounding Flash letter goes to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward.
  turnin 94825 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Confounding Flash: a letter from another trainer
  when onquest 94826
  zone Ironforge
  tip Any Confounding Flash letter goes to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward.
  turnin 94826 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Confounding Flash

step Contingency Plan: High Priestess Laurena
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  when !onquest 94818,94819,94820
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 20 in Stormwind, High Priestess Laurena at the altar of the Cathedral of Light hands you a Contingency Plan letter for High Priestess Mims in Ironforge (the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District).
  level 20
  talk 376                                    -- High Priestess Laurena: take her Contingency Plan letter

step Contingency Plan: High Priestess Mims
  when !onquest 94818,94819,94820
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 20, High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries teaches Contingency Plan with a quest she gives and takes back at once. Contingency Plan wards a friend for 30 seconds: if they drop below 35% health, they get a shield and a heal over time at once (it stacks with Renew and Power Word: Shield). 5-minute cooldown.
  level 20
  accept 94818 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims
  turnin 94818 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Contingency Plan

step Contingency Plan: Laurena's letter
  when onquest 94819
  zone Ironforge
  tip Hand Laurena's letter to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward: the Deeprun Tram from Stormwind's Dwarven District.
  turnin 94819                                -- High Priestess Mims: Contingency Plan

step Contingency Plan: a letter from another trainer
  when onquest 94820
  zone Ironforge
  tip Any Contingency Plan letter goes to High Priestess Mims in the Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge's Mystic Ward.
  turnin 94820 npc 258785                     -- High Priestess Mims: Contingency Plan
